WEBVTT

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:12.490
Rafael - one of Doma's Three Musketeers - awaits with a silent fighting spirit.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.600
His aura tells me that he's a powerful opponent.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.840
Rafael, you said that we both fight destiny.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.550
But I won't lose!

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.990
No justice will allow this world to be destroyed!

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:48.040
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:55.180
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:01.840
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:07.830
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:15.200
With our memories fading

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:22.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:29.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:36.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:02.070
The Truth About Doma

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:06.810
I won't use The Seal of Orichalcos in this duel.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.140
This one strike will deal critical damage.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.410
Go!  Guardian Grarl!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.810
Decisive Slash!

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:40.000
What?

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:50.180
Too bad.  Kuribee's effect drops all other monsters' attack points to 0.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.120
And negates the Battle Phase once!

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:59.420
I see.  I underestimated your cute minions.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:08.520
Neither has an overwhelming lead yet.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:12.800
But Doma has The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.470
The question is when he'll activate it.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:24.380
We'll be in Death Valley once we cross that bridge.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.050
Hold on, Yugi!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.160
Are we good?

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:39.720
Huh?

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.370
We're not good at all!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:05.060
My grandpa told me that Yugi has two personalities.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:10.230
Regular Yugi and Yugi with the Nameless Pharaoh's soul.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:14.290
Yes.  The other Yugi is really dependable.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.650
He's also great at dueling.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.670
So he'll win this one, too.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.110
Anzu, so you like the Pharaoh Yugi.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.810
That's out of the blue.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:33.240
But we won't be rivals because I like the regular Yugi.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.490
When I first met him...

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:46.050
He taught me something important by losing the duel on purpose.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.330
My darling is very kind.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.430
He's always thoughtful.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.770
Yeah.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:02.080
Like you said, the Pharaoh Yugi and my darling will be fine.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.730
When they work together, no one can defeat them.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.360
My turn!

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:20.270
Purity of the Cemetery now activates!

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.630
You have three monsters in your graveyard.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:26.300
Therefore, you lose 300 life points.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.520
Stay patient, my other self.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.520
We still have a chance.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.870
I know, partner.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:39.420
I activate the spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:43.090
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:48.730
There's a card in my deck that can turn the tables.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.390
It's...

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:03.480
I activate the five Kuriboh brothers' effect to summon Kuribabylon!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.510
I tribute Kuribabylon!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:18.010
Since that spell summoned the Kuribohs, they can't be used to Tribute Summon.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:22.330
But he combined them to force them to tribute.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:25.900
I'll summon this monster!  Come out!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.920
Dark Magician Girl!

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.310
Dark Magician Girl.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:40.050
Master!  You must defeat the evil god!

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:43.550
Or our two worlds will be destroyed!

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.520
I'll never forget that promise!

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:55.730
Unless I defeat Doma, our world and the Duel Monsters' world won't be at peace!

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.290
Behold, Rafael!

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.240
This is my ace card!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.530
Eye of Timaeus!

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:13.060
So this is Timaeus!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.910
Timaeus!  Combine with Dark Magician Girl!

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:21.240
Awaken a new power!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.460
I summon Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight!

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.980
What's that card?

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.340
He combined a card in his hand with a monster on his field!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:44.010
So they did get special cards!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.770
Here I go!

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:54.010
Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight, attack Guardian Grarl!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:59.530
Why?  That monster has fewer attack points than Guardian Grarl!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:03.190
Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight's effect!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:10.170
By discarding a card, I can reduce the damage to 0 and destroy your monster!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.100
What?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.210
Go!  Black Dragon Burst!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:34.560
This is the legendary dragon's power.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:36.990
I did it.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:38.560
It's not over.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.930
My set card, Self Tribute!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:00.850
What?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:09.660
When my monster is destroyed, Self Tribute allows me to keep it by paying 1000 life points.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:13.930
My Guardian Grarl is unhurt.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.830
He exchanged his life points for his monster.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.540
Why would he go this far?

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:26.850
Nameless Pharaoh, we'll never lose to you.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.980
Do you know why?

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:34.980
Because the Doma has a strength that you don't have.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.920
A strength that we don't have?

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:42.090
Yes.  The strength to admit that darkness exists in our hearts.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.020
Darkness in our hearts?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:49.840
Just as there's light in our hearts, there's also darkness.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:53.820
The world is like a balance scale.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:10:00.210
It's only natural for light and darkness to be on opposing sides of the scale.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.560
If your bond is the light in your hearts...

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:08.150
...then Doma's bond believe in the darkness in our hearts.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.690
Your bond believes in the darkness in your hearts...

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:16.970
Yes.  The darkness in our hearts is beyond the light.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.880
It's in the abyss of despair.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:27.140
An abyss so deep that you can't see it with your self-righteous sense of justice.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:33.070
Our despair and sadness are the greatest burden in this world.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.470
Those views are wrong!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:39.010
What can you achieve with revenge and destruction?

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:42.020
All that's left will be emptiness!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.970
You're right.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:51.690
If I act half-heartedly, only emptiness will be left.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:55.230
But what if there's even no emptiness?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.660
What?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.680
I'll tell you Doma's true goal.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.460
It's nothingness.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.840
To return history to zero.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.510
What?

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:28.900
What are they talking about?

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.770
I can't hear a thing!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.460
You'll return mankind's history to zero?

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:37.260
Doma used to be observers of history.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.890
Observers?

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:43.750
An ancient organization that's existed since humans started creating history.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.440
That's Doma.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:54.770
Doma showed and led mankind on the path they should follow.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:01.760
At times, we supported culture.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:07.770
Other times, we used cruel tactics to guide history.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.340
But against Doma's intentions...

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:21.550
...humans repeated mistakes for millennia, not knowing their place in the world.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:26.340
Yugi, of all the creatures in the world...

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.650
...why are humans the only ones endowed with wisdom?

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:36.940
Because humanity's duty is to become guardians and protect this planet.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:40.500
Humans are guardians?

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.450
And yet, look around.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:53.180
Beyond the horizon, selfish people are ruining the world and shedding unnecessary blood.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:58.790
Mankind's foolishness went beyond what Doma imagined!

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:01.960
Humans will eventually destroy this planet.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.200
So Doma changed its goal.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.030
Instead of guiding human history...

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.560
...we will reset it.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.280
Reset history?  No way!

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:16.770
You can't make that decision alone!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.260
It's not our decision.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.210
It's Doma's leader's decision.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:29.330
The one who ruled and brought paradise to this world.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.090
Used to rule the world?

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:39.530
Nameless Pharaoh, there's also darkness in your heart.

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:44.460
Have you ever imagined what kind of Pharaoh you were?

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:50.400
What you did with your absolute power and authority?

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:54.880
What I did...

00:13:55.660 --> 00:14:00.660
Can you truly say you were a good Pharaoh?

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.330
It can't be...  Did I destroy that city?

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:07.360
No!  It can't be!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.600
I don't believe it!

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.830
I've never relied on the darkness in my heart!

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:21.000
Then prove that there's light in your heart, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:22.610
My turn.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:29.780
I set a card and activate a spell card.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.410
Exchange.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:39.420
Exchange forces us to swap one card in our hands with each other.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.860
We both only have one card in our hands.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.280
So we must exchange them.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.260
Necromancy.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:02.550
This card resurrects a monster in the opponent's graveyard.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.280
I don't have any monsters in my graveyard.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:09.050
It's powerless in your hands.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.220
Hand over your card.

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:18.160
Take your card of destiny, Yugi.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.830
My card of destiny?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:29.160
No way!  This card is...

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.700
What card did he get?

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:38.580
This card is...

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.510
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:46.840
Yugi, you have a piece of the Orichalcos that you took from Gurimo.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:57.900
I told you that I wouldn't use The Seal of Orichalcos during this duel.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:01.280
It's you who'll use the card.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:05.260
You know that card's power.

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:09.690
If you're weak-hearted, your heart's darkness will enslave you.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:14.340
But a duelist like you should be able to use it.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:19.520
If you deny that there's darkness in your heart, then master that card!

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:25.520
My other self, don't use that card!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.690
Partner...

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.630
I feel evil power coming from that card!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.420
I know, partner.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.250
I can win without using this card.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.640
My turn!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:41.560
The Continuous Spell, Purity of the Cemetery's effect activates!

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:47.010
There are five monsters in your graveyard, so you lose 500 life points.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:54.050
Go, Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.260
Attack Guardian Grarl again!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.890
The trap card, Crystal Seal!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.250
What?

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:18.140
Dark Magician Girl!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:25.780
The monster targeted by Crystal Seal can't attack nor be tributed.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:32.760
But the seal will be removed if the captured monster's attack points change.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:43.200
If I get rid of the legendary dragon's fearsome power, victory is mine.

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:48.900
Dark Magician Girl, I promise to save you.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:53.950
I summon a monster in facedown defense position!

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.880
I end my turn!

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:03.310
He's determined not to use The Seal of Orichalcos.  However...

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.300
My turn!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.900
The spell card, Rod of Silence - Kay'est!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:16.770
Rod of Silence raises the equipped monster's defense points by 500.

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:22.370
And I activate Rod of Silence's effect!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:26.010
I can bring Guardian Kay'est to the field!

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:35.570
Guardian Grarl, destroy Yugi's defending monster!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.460
Decisive Slash!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:43.760
Big Shield Gardna...

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.320
My attack hasn't ended yet.

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:49.940
Guardian Kay'est, attack Yugi directly!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.980
Surging Scream!

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.150
I end my turn.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:16.220
Yugi, it seems the next turn will end this duel.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:17.820
Not yet!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:24.860
Due to Purity of the Cemetery's effect, you lose 600 life points!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:28.770
At this rate, there's no way you can win.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:34.480
You'll lose to me without proving there's light in your heart.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:38.000
I'm going to lose?

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:46.220
I promised to save two worlds!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:50.900
I can't afford to lose here!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.800
I activate the spell card, Card of Sanctity!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:20:00.420
Both players must draw until they have six cards in their hands!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.640
That's pointless, Yugi.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.220
If I use this card...

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:16.720
Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight's attack points will rise to 3100 and revive.

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:19.660
It's the only way to make a comeback.

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.780
No, my other self!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.840
Partner!

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.740
You can't use this card!

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.900
But...

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.840
He's waiting for you to use this card!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:35.840
But if I don't, I'll definitely lose.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:38.840
Partner, this is my fight!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:41.940
My justice and beliefs are at stake!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.850
My other self...

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:50.020
I activate this card from my hand!

00:20:57.090 --> 00:21:00.110
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:18.860
That's...

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.850
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.690
What's that light?

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:29.590
It's Yugi!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:07.110
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:15.520
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:26.610
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:36.130
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:45.160
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:50.670
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:55.850
For me to be me

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:04.310
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:09.950
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:19.680
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:24.990 --> 00:23:30.340
Pushed to the brink, Yugi finally activated The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:35.230
Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight becomes a dark monster and gains attack points.

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:38.050
This should remove Crystal Seal...

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.940
Oh no!  Timaeus!

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:42.450
Rafael was waiting for this moment!

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:44.650
Please don't lose, Yugi!

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:46.960
If you lose, this world will end!

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:51.230
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Darkness Inside Yugi
Timaeus Vanishes

00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:52.900
Duel, standby!
